{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>「行走的CD」林俊傑（JJ）自去年底公開認愛比他年輕21歲的女友七七（Annalisa）後，二人的戀情一直備受關注。向來甚少分享感情生活的他，昨日（25日）罕有在社交平台限時動態「放閃」，他分享了兩張為女友慶生的照片，更送上蛋糕與禮物，甜蜜滿瀉。</p><figure><img alt=\"林俊傑與女友七七在世界盃決賽現場被網民捕捉。（小紅書圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260720/1155869302822277120158372.jpeg/dY8HN8UH_oIaCRiVQHsEdGqpi4PxZqv2NA05czQNOXM\"/><figcaption>林俊傑與女友七七在世界盃決賽現場被網民捕捉。（小紅書圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林俊傑認愛後愈放高調。（JFJ Productions）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185601271613100032058914.png/_4YDznc3PY_WpRXfQ5NXLLV1dwnR4s22S1uS80tbkvM\"/><figcaption>林俊傑認愛後愈放高調。（JFJ Productions）</figcaption></figure><p>送印名禮盒與蛋糕顯儀式感 直接標註帳號流露愛意</p><p>其中一張照片是生日禮物包裝相，白色紙盒以優雅字體印上女友英文名字Annalisa。另一張則是士多啤梨生日蛋糕，插有英文生日祝福牌，簡單卻充滿儀式感。雖然未有公開二人合照，JJ仍直接標註女友帳號，低調流露愛意，浪漫十足。</p><figure><img alt=\"林俊傑罕有放閃。(ig圖片)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261126/1202444408482566144596281.jpeg/PeRmrD7GZYVR2xNsxSV2MhX8-vnbJxAtqvivsar4r7E\"/><figcaption>林俊傑罕有放閃。(ig圖片)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林俊傑Tag女友帳號。(ig圖片)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261126/1202444406062321664921704.jpeg/NqMJ2Y9mhiiXpHLCAn_XkOD1At-e3-Z2QcrZuUHK2bk\"/><figcaption>林俊傑Tag女友帳號。(ig圖片)</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T19:24:16.954343+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":349,"images":4,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T19:07:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T20:28:45.411568+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T19:17:45.119917+00:00","content_hash":"7f3cc49a094aefbdc56070b6d744f46847edd4f75cde7df91cabf2e8a99f81ee","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}